# Cafe Zauner's entrance door (Stage 9 start, back layer, no k): the
# dark-green G/j double door in a G frame (g lit left edge, j right),
# a G fascia with the gold Y/o script mark of the Bad Ischl facade
# (two loops shorter; no letters), tall glass panes showing the
# Pfarrgasse outside (h sky, p/c facades with T windows, i street) and
# the queue as tiny figures, an s reflection streak per pane, brass Y/o
# handles, G/g kick panels, an i/m threshold. Frame 1: the fourth
# figure lifts her phone. Placement: bottom centre on the floor.
